Subject: Clang frontend support (HasUnion tracking, dual DataLayout in TargetInfo, preprocessor & cpuid)
Upstream-Base: llvmorg-20.1.8 (87f0227cb60147a26a1eeb4fb06e3b505e9c7261)
Fil-C-Head: cede3de02b42b58a14acc9ce39c9894ab952a915 (branch deluge)

Tracks union containment on RecordDecl/QualType in AST and Sema, splits
TargetInfo DataLayout into BeforeFilC/AfterFilC, adds Fil-C version/macro
definitions, and adapts cpuid.h for Fil-C.

